---
---

<section class="relative py-[180px] pb-[100px] overflow-hidden min-h-[60vh] flex items-center bg-bg">
  <div class="hero-bg absolute inset-0">
    <div class="hero-orb hero-orb-1 !w-[600px] !h-[600px] bg-accent -top-[200px] -right-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container max-w-[900px] relative z-[1]">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 pl-2 bg-[rgba(115,96,248,0.15)] border border-[rgba(139,92,246,0.25)] rounded-full text-[0.78rem] font-semibold text-accent-light tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">
      <div class="w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-accent rounded-full" style="animation:pulse 2s infinite"></div>
      <span data-i18n="about.badge">Who we are</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-white text-[clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.8rem)] font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight font-display [&_span]:text-accent-light" data-i18n="about.title">Engineered for <br/><span>Ecommerce</span> Performance.</h1>
    <p class="text-base text-gray-2 max-w-[520px] leading-relaxed font-normal" data-i18n="about.sub">
      We bridge the gap between high-end brand identity and technical growth engineering. EMRG is a founder-led studio built for the next generation of DTC brands.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-[100px] bg-bg-2">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] gap-[100px] md:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[2.5rem] md:text-[2rem] font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight" data-i18n="about.story_title">Our Story</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text mb-7" data-i18n="about.story_p1">
          EMRG was founded on a simple observation: the most successful ecommerce brands don't just have good products; they have integrated systems. Most agencies focus on either the "creative" or the "technical" side. We do both, simultaneously.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text" data-i18n="about.story_p2">
          By treating the brand, the store, and the growth infrastructure as a single cohesive unit, we eliminate the friction that usually slows down scaling.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:justify-between">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
          <div class="text-[2.5rem] font-extrabold text-white leading-none mb-1">7d</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Avg. Launch</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
          <div class="text-[2.5rem] font-extrabold text-white leading-none mb-1">100%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Founder Led</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
          <div class="text-[2.5rem] font-extrabold text-white leading-none mb-1">20+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-2 uppercase tracking-widest">DTC Successes</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-section bg-bg reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mb-16 max-w-[600px]">
      <h2 class="text-[2.5rem] md:text-[2rem] font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight" data-i18n="about.focus_title">Strategic Focus</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-2" data-i18n="about.focus_sub">We specialize in industries where precision and performance are non-negotiable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <a href="/enfoque-salud" class="bg-bg-2 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-10 rounded-[20px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-[400ms] no-underline relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-accent hover:bg-[rgba(0,229,200,0.02)]">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-accent opacity-60 tracking-widest mb-6">01</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4" data-i18n="about.focus_salud">Enfoque en Salud</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1" data-i18n="about.focus_salud_desc">Technical performance for health and wellness brands.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tracking-wide">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/enfoque-legal" class="bg-bg-2 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-10 rounded-[20px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-[400ms] no-underline relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-accent hover:bg-[rgba(0,229,200,0.02)]">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-accent opacity-60 tracking-widest mb-6">02</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4" data-i18n="about.focus_legal">Enfoque Legal</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1" data-i18n="about.focus_legal_desc">Rigid branding and communication systems for law firms.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tracking-wide">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/enfoque-pymes" class="bg-bg-2 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-10 rounded-[20px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-[400ms] no-underline relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-accent hover:bg-[rgba(0,229,200,0.02)]">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-accent opacity-60 tracking-widest mb-6">03</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4" data-i18n="about.focus_pymes">Enfoque Emprendedore/PYMES</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1" data-i18n="about.focus_pymes_desc">Scalable growth engines for small and medium businesses.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tracking-wide">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/enfoque-retail" class="bg-bg-2 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-10 rounded-[20px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-[400ms] no-underline relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-accent hover:bg-[rgba(0,229,200,0.02)]">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-accent opacity-60 tracking-widest mb-6">04</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4" data-i18n="about.focus_retail">Enfoque Retail/Mayoristas</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1" data-i18n="about.focus_retail_desc">Complex B2B and B2C infrastructure for scale.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tracking-wide">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/enfoque-marca-personal" class="bg-bg-2 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-10 rounded-[20px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-[400ms] no-underline relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-accent hover:bg-[rgba(0,229,200,0.02)]">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-accent opacity-60 tracking-widest mb-6">05</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4" data-i18n="about.focus_personal">Enfoque Marca Personal</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1" data-i18n="about.focus_personal_desc">Authority systems for experts and thought leaders.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent tracking-wide">Explore →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
